+   board C: bound 42.5 pF, nominal 30.0 pF: J_PANEL.5 conn, TP43.1 tp, U1.22 PCA9555, U2.22 PCA9555, U3.3 RP2040, U7.3 USBLC6, U_LIGHT.1 VEML7700
+   board D: bound 10.0 pF, nominal 4.0 pF: J_HARN1.11 conn, U16.22 PCA9555
